        <mxCell id="ov_note" value="&lt;b&gt;How to use this file&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Each coloured block above is a hyperlink — click it to jump to that subsystem's detail page.&lt;br&gt;• Every detail page has a &lt;b&gt;◀ Back to Overview&lt;/b&gt; button in the top-left corner.&lt;br&gt;• Page tabs at the bottom of the draw.io window let you move between sheets directly.&lt;br&gt;• Solid arrows = signal / data flow.  Dashed orange arrows = power rails.  Double arrows = bidirectional." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#F8F9FA;strokeColor=#B3B3B3;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="560" width="830" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

